  "question": {
    "text": "The first three terms of an arithmetic-geometric progression are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math> The next term of the progression is"
  },
