  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the first four terms of the&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;be<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> or <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />(i) for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo></math> next term is<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />(ii) for <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>;</mo></math> next term is<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>27</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />So, the next term is <math><mn>3</mn></math> or <math><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
